Water Bodies learning

The scientific processing chain and staged application patterns follow EOAP's
mastering-app-package reference, including its feature/enhancements branch.
Upstream work is attributed to Terradue and the EOAP contributors under Apache-2.0.

The Click interface is generated by Transpiler-Mate cwl2click. Derived projections
use the plugins identified in docs/upstream-lock.json and docs/architecture.md.

Bundled STAC extension JSON Schemas are unmodified upstream documents identified
by their $id values, distributed under the STAC extension repositories' Apache-2.0
licenses. They enable offline validation, rather than redefining those contracts.
